  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2025-11-19T11:32:26.382Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "1. Open VRChat\n\n2. Once loaded and in your home world, go to an instance of Virtual French Furs.\n\n3. From there, you'll be able to witness different weird behaviors with minigames, available at center of the map :\n\n- Pool : it's possible to enter a pool game, take the cues, and bring them anywhere in the map, making the pool unusable since it's locked (only the one who entered first the pool can do something and reset it) ;\n\n- Connect 4 : after some games, it can glitch and players will not be able to see the opponent plays their piece, making it softlocked ;\n\n- Ball Cups : it's possible to drag the balls and make them spawn elsewhere, idk how precisely though ;\n\n- Pens : also happens in the map French Vibes, once pens are taken and scattered all across the map, pressing the reset button does not make them come back.\n\nAccording to theghost87, creator of the map, on Discord : \"Hey there, I see, but the problem is that all these bugs appeared with a VRChat update, and I have no idea what they did to break everything like that.\"\n\nAnd according to the VRC Support AI, this behavior could come from Udon scripts not up to date, notably with an update that happened in march, but it can also come from higher levels, something that vrchat devs would like to check to analyse what's going on in order to see what to do best.",
